# Wana OS system groups (Buildroot makeusers format, see the Buildroot manual
# "Makeusers syntax"). A username of "-" creates only the group.
#
# eudev's rules (50-udev-default.rules) give device nodes to these groups;
# Buildroot's skeleton /etc/group does not have them, and udevd logs an error
# for every rule that names an unknown group. Fixed GIDs keep /etc/group and
# device ownership identical from build to build.
#
# user uid group gid password home shell groups comment
- -1 input 101 - - - - -
- -1 kvm   102 - - - - -
- -1 sgx   103 - - - - -
